## 10. Vòng đời vận hành

### 10.1 Settle pipeline

```
prepare-settle → settle-entries → calculate-financials → apply-split-bonuses → build-report → finalize-settle → sync-ticket-summaries
```

Đặc biệt ở Power 6/55: `calculate-financials` tính **dual jackpot** (jp1Contribution, jp2Contribution, jp1Overflow). `apply-split-bonuses` kích hoạt khi tổng JP1+JP2 >= splitThreshold.

### 10.2 Void pipeline

```
prepare-void → void-entries → dispatch-refunds → finalize-void
```

